        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:9",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And he inquired of the Lord for him, and gave him victuals, and gave him the sword of Goliath the Philistine.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "HEB goods, provisions."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:10",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Then the king sent to call Ahimelech the priest, the son of Ahitub, and all his father’s house, the priests that were in Nob: and they came all of them to the king.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 113,
            "end": 117
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:11",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And Saul said, Hear now, thou son of Ahitub. And he answered, Here I am, my lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 72
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:12",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And Saul said unto him, Why have ye conspired against me, thou and the son of Jesse, in that thou hast given him bread, and a sword, and hast inquired of God for him, that he should rise against me, to lie in wait, as at this day?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:13",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Then Ahimelech answered the king, and said, And who is so faithful among all thy servants as David, which is the king’s son in law, and goeth at thy bidding, and is honourable in thine house?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 57
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:14",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Did I then begin to inquire of God for him? be it far from me: let not the king impute any thing unto his servant, nor to all the house of my father: for thy servant knew nothing of all this, less or more.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 90
          },
          {
            "start": 115,
            "end": 118
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:15",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king said, Thou shalt surely die, Ahimelech, thou, and all thy father’s house.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:16",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king said unto the footmen that stood about him, Turn, and slay the priests of the Lord; because their hand also is with David, and because they knew when he fled, and did not shew it to me. But the servants of the king would not put forth their hand to fall upon the priests of the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 121,
            "end": 123
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:17",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king said to Doeg, Turn thou, and fall upon the priests. And Doeg the Edomite turned, and he fell upon the priests, and slew on that day fourscore and five persons that did wear a linen ephod.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 194,
            "end": 199,
            "text": "Ex. 28:4 (2–4); 1 Sam. 2:28; 14:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:18",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And Nob, the city of the priests, smote he with the edge of the sword, both men and women, children and sucklings, and oxen, and asses, and sheep, with the edge of the sword.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 22:19",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And one of the sons of Ahimelech the son of Ahitub, named Abiathar, escaped, and fled after David.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "2 Sam. 15:24; 1 Kgs. 2:26."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "2 Sam. 15:24; 1 Kgs. 2:26.",
            "prettyString": "2 Samuel 15:24; 1 Kings 2:26",
            "references": [
              {
